WEBVTT

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.460
Periodic report.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:10.460
This is Monika of Weissflügel: 
Landosol Branch.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.640
I have a report to share regarding 
the Landosol investigation.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:51.960
<b></b>Menu 6 <b> Code Name: Monika </b> 
~Bouillabaisse Is Best Enjoyed Hot~

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.140
A mysterious knight?

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.150
Mm!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.160
Oh, yeah, I've heard rumors 
about that lately.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.060
The scary, elusive one who 
keeps attacking people, right?

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.490
What's that all about?!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.900
If there's someone like that about,
 no one can eat in peace!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:29.400
All you ever think about is food, isn't it?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.790
Tomorrow, we'll go and accept that quest!

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.390
For everyone!

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:34.650
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.180
Peco lady!

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.790
Heya!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.550
Oh! Heya!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.680
Did you hear about the bridge 
that collapsed yesterday?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.190
A bridge collapsed?

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.430
What's wrong?

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:55.410
Do you have a tummyache 
or something, Monika?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:59.620
No! Ninon, is this really 
the time for physical labor?

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:03.030
We need quests! Quests 
that'll make us more money!

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.720
You hear me, Yuki and Kuka?!

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:10.210
Even covered in mud, I look so cute.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.970
Dirtier... I wanna be even dirtier!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:19.160
More... Mess me up more...

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:20.690
<i>We started this guild as a front for 
a spy operation to help our homeland,</i>

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.830
<i>but I had no idea they were all so useless.</i>

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.940
Yes! We did it!

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.860
Now the reward money is ours!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:36.260
Being covered in gastric juices
 is a new look for me, but it's so cute.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:40.690
So this is what they mean 
by "flying high"...

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:42.740
Bravo, Mount Fuji!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.730
It's not a celebration without these!

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.070
You id—

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.210
I can't believe it took 
out the whole bridge.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:03.550
We managed to get out 
of being thrown in jail,

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.160
but that put us in massive debt.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.490
Argh! Money! We need money!

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:12.730
Listen up, people! Whether you're 
spacing out or panting like a dog,

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.990
we're going looking for quests tomorrow!

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.230
Late, late...

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.060
Find her?

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:24.600
No, but she can't have gotten far yet.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.960
You, there! Have you seen 
a girl with red hair?

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.870
A girl?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:36.010
A girl who dances at our restaurant 
has been acting strange recently.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:38.680
Today, she just wandered 
out of the restaurant.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.030
I'm worried about her!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.310
I can't say this too loudly,

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:47.130
but have you heard about the dangerous 
potion that's been the talk of the town?

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.210
Dangerous?

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:53.220
It was created by a back-alley 
doctor named Mitsuki.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.860
Taking it makes you feel
 a sense of euphoria

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.210
and see things that aren't there.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.930
But it affects both the body and the mind...

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.780
Sorry, but if you see her,

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.940
would you please stop her before 
she steps onto the wrong path?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.590
Got it.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.050
It affects both the body and the mind...

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.170
Don't! Bad!

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.340
Who are you?!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.880
I-I-I-It's not what you think!

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:34.380
This enormous pile of 
erotic books isn't mine!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:38.310
They're just... They come and go, 
you know... I mean, uh...

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.470
I'm worried about her... 
I'm worried about her...

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.320
I'm worried about her... 
I'm worried about her...

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:43.900
Burn.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.730
Wait, please! Don't burn 
these wonderful books!

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:47.630
Rip!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.830
Please, no!

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:51.080
I need these books!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.640
The guilty pleasure they give me when 
I slip out of work to read them...

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:00.010
Mr. Sadist?! You're such an animal!

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:03.000
<b>PriConne</b>

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.690
Do your best at work!

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:06.950
Say, Mister! Looking for some fun?

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:07.640
Was it really a good idea 
to split up into two teams?

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:12.020
Well, Yuuki and Kokkoro have 
gotten much more reliable.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.030
Yeah, you might be right.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:17.420
H-Hey! Stop treating me like a child!

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.360
This is a bar, kid!

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.280
No drinking until you're an adult!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.590
Hey! I'm only here to get 
one of my guild members!

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.140
Just let me inside!

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:29.070
Oh, you're Kuka's buddy?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.630
She already took off for the day.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:36.650
Kid, if she's your buddy, tell her 
not to step onto the wrong path!

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:37.420
I'm worried about her!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.700
Wrong path?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.850
Are you okay?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.760
It was immature of him 
to do that to a child.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.330
I'm not a child! I'm a soldier of—

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.520
Pardon me. I'm busy, so I have to go now.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.090
My lord, have you had any luck?

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:00.370
Mm-mm.

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:20.670
This is...

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.500
My lord!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:41.640
I won't allow you to harm 
the people of Landosol!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.920
That armor... I don't 
know where you got that,

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:49.040
but you are a scoundrel for 
terrorizing the people!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.530
Give yourself up!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:07.880
You won't escape!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:12.430
That armor looked like the 
armor of the palace knights.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:26.340
It seems I've lost the trail.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:27.810
Big Sis Tomo!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:32.450
Apparently the mystery knight 
showed up again this evening.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:37.430
Mystery aside, the sight described 
in the reports was...

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:40.500
Hey, you think it's those Nightmare creeps?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:44.850
I bet this so-called mystery 
knight is their captain.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:50.080
What kind of "palace knight" goes around 
busting up the town and attacking people?

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:53.750
Our captain would never do that!

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.660
Our captain is...

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.150
Wait, Matsuri.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.390
We need to figure out the truth first.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.070
Let's give it our all again today!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.400
Yeah!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.480
You sure are fired up.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.720
Captain...

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.370
Are you all right, Matsuri?

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.410
Huh? B-Big Sis Tomo...

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:36.720
Sorry about that.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:38.310
It's not a problem.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:41.970
You've been patrolling through the 
night for several days in a row.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.200
Here. Have this.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.960
That satisfies every fiber of my tired body.

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.750
What's wrong?

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:01.310
I still can't believe it.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:08.630
No one tried to protect this place, 
Landosol, as much as she did...

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:10.270
Big Sis Tomo!

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:20.500
What's going on here? 
Is this a wake or something?

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.890
Vice Captain.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.780
These things are good.

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:33.210
Where've you been, old lady?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.210
And while all this crazy stuff's going on?

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.690
Watch your mouth, kiddo.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:43.860
Grown-ups have a lot to deal with, you know.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.030
Oh, how boring!

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:54.910
If only she'd just bust onto the 
scene and start rampaging, right?

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:58.270
A fight to the death with 
the captain sure sounds fun!

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.630
Vice Captain!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.070
If it's really her, that is.

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:10.470
What part of the captain have 
you two been looking at?

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:12.130
She may be inflexible,

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:17.140
but do you think she's the kind of 
fool who'd betray her own beliefs?

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.160
Thanks for the snack.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.650
Why don't you explain to 
me what this is all about?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.270
I just looked so cute yesterday,

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.580
I couldn't tear myself away from the mirror.

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:41.200
I was working on my latest fireworks 
and suddenly it was morning!

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.050
I was experiencing the 
extremely high-level play

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:49.160
of having my treasured tomes 
burned in front of me.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:51.820
It got me so worked up, I passed out!

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.460
Argh! Forget it!

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.550
I don't want to hear any more!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:00.600
If you don't get serious about working, 
we'll never pay off our debt!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:05.290
Looks like those brats didn't 
show up to fix the bridge today.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.060
They're not keeping up with 
their repayment at all.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.630
Guess we gotta put 'em on the tuna boat.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.160
Yeah, guess so.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.490
Once they've experienced hell,

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:17.260
maybe they'll understand this 
world ain't a walk in the park.

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:22.470
Or maybe they'll just fall 
prey to Great Thunnus.

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:26.870
Calm down, Monika.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.250
Look. I found this.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:31.020
What is this?

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:35.030
It's called a bribe.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:40.020
Once this toy has soothed your heart,

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:44.880
you will kindly forgive us.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.010
That's the plan!

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:49.850
Are you mocking me?!

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:51.510
I'm not a child!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.270
It's just like abandonment play!

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:57.550
You know this toy well!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:00.610
Stop making everything perverted.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.880
What's the deal with this toy?

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:18.910
Is it... alive?

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.540
Whoa, check out this toy! What is it?

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.400
It's like it's alive!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.090
Is it magic?

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:27.040
What makes it do that?

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.710
Is it because of this springy thing?

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.980
Hey! Sell this toy to me!

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.510
I want one, too!

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:38.190
Hang on! I'll pay 10,000 rupees for it!

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:39.540
I'll pay 15,000!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.180
20,000!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.020
Wh-Why is this thing so popular?!

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:45.520
Are the people of this town crazy?!

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:50.770
That's it!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:01.230
If we find a whole colony of these 
creatures and put them in toys,

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.260
they're sure to sell like hotcakes!

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:06.370
Way to go, boss! Brilliant as always!

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:10.020
Forget catching some 
so-called mystery knight.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.240
This is our path to an instant comeback!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:15.080
We have no reason to fear 
that tuna boat now!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.120
Sukiyaki! Geisha!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.610
Yay!

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:22.520
Wow! Look how much my rods are reacting!

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:25.100
Excellent! They're probably just below us!

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:27.820
That's a reaction we can put our hopes in!

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.720
Dig! Dig! Our fortune awaits!

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.930
What's that? Did we finally hit gold?

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.600
Yes! Our time has come at last!

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.910
Thanks for everything.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:09.180
Give good dreams to some 
other guys now, okay?

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:13.270
And don't get yourselves burned next time.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.670
Gentlemen I've yet to meet...

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:21.490
Have a good time, yo—

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.090
What is it?

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:33.880
The swordfighter from yesterday!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.050
You're...

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.570
Never mind. I'm glad you're safe.

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:43.410
Thank you very much for your help.

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:45.420
Oh, you're hurt?

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:48.420
Ah, so I am.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:51.790
Forgive me for being forward, 
but please let me treat you.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.940
Has it been like this since last night?

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.700
There are people I wish to protect,

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:05.090
and a nation I wish to protect.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.780
For their sakes...

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:11.200
Our captain would never do that!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.740
I must keep looking forward.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:21.340
I also want

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:25.810
to protect the smiles of 
this nation's people.

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:29.610
Run!

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.480
It's the mystery knight!

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:35.040
Why, Captain?!

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:39.420
I didn't want to believe it until 
I saw it with my own eyes...

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.530
But if someone is doing the people wrong...

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:45.040
I will defeat them, even if it's you!

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:50.560
That is the chivalry we learned from 
you in order to protect this kingdom!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.930
Darn it...

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.680
Well said, Tomo.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:14.960
That's why you're a member of Nightmare, 
the palace knights.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.370
Captain!

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.210
So it wasn't you after all, Captain!

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:22.470
Now, everyone, let us protect Landosol!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.220
Yeah!

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:27.690
Now I know you're a fake,
 I won't hold back!

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:32.050
Tiger Hero Bomber!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.870
Mikuma Style Secret Technique:

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.400
Asura!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.120
Armor Break!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.620
We can do this!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:04.730
Wh-What?!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:08.140
What the heck is that?!

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:12.540
Wh-What is that thing?

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.850
That's what we wanna know!

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.040
This...

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.870
is pretty crazy, huh?

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:25.710
I think it might be a lot 
crazier than you're thinking!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:28.370
Peco lady!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.380
Help!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.490
That's the kid from yesterday!

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:34.750
And Kuka, too!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.800
This has turned into a huge mess!

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.520
Hang tight, kid!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.530
I'm coming to save you!

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.580
You people need to run!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.160
Hmph! They're fellow residents of Landosol!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.390
I can't just leave them like that!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.090
Koro-ster!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:03.900
Right!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.920
Wind spirits!

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:12.860
Now!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:18.890
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:29.520
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:26.410
Don't you dare give up!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:39.150
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.240
Inferno Shield!

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:40.900
I'm worried... I'm worried about you!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.030
We did it!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.420
Pecorine!

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:44.290
Right!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:48.290
Princess Strike!

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:59.800
I'm sorry for causing so much anxiety.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.650
No, the vice captain warned me.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:04.870
Chris did?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.500
She may be incredibly vague,

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:13.070
but she seemed to know that you weren't 
the one behind this incident.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.170
It made me understand why 
she's the vice captain.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.440
I see.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:24.200
Thanks. You saved my life.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.250
You've had it pretty rough.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.690
Why don't you rest for a bit?

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.500
N-No, please let me do this.

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:34.340
I feel like I really need to do this.

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:36.770
Since you're working so hard...

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:38.700
Here. This is for you.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.910
Delicious.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:20:59.730
Periodic report.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:04.350
This is Monika of Weissflügel: 
Landosol Branch.

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:07.960
I have a report to share regarding 
the Landosol investigation.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:11.380
Obstruction by unjust financial institutions

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:15.610
and harassment resulting from ignorant 
prejudices such as age restrictions

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:18.280
are interfering with my 
investigation of the town.

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:20.630
For some reason, I am turned away 
from bars and other establishments

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.630
that cater to adults.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:25.320
Yet places such as toy stores 
openly invite me in...

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.730
Blast it!

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:30.300
Just you watch!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:35.690
Once I hit my growth spurt, 
I'll investigate all kinds of shops!

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:47.860
But still...

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:54.080
<i>Their consideration for others and 
their feelings toward their country</i>

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:57.190
<i>are concepts that would be 
understood even in my homeland.</i>

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:02.390
<i>It appears I'll need more time 
to learn about this nation.</i>

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.970
Menu 7<b> The Prankster Pixie
  ~Cuore in the Mist~</b>
